DFS servers, i looked into the replication options.. for DFS 2022..

hub and spoke - 3 or more servers - pick a central server (hub) that replicates with multiple branch servers
full mesh - at least 2 servers or more - replicates data to every other member in the group
no topology - (custom topology) -  Creates a blank group so you can manually define custom connections later

in a full mesh topology,
if its only 2 servers then you have bi-directional traffic..
if its 3+ servers then every server replicates to each other, for example 4 servers require 6 connections

looking at the options on the table i think the best replication topology would be a custom topology where
each server within the same datacenter is connected with a bidirectional connection for quick local replication,
and a second connection between the 2 servers in datacenter B..

